    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro top-down RPG shooter indie game where you play as Mr. Shorty: the heroic ranger in the wild west. Unlock weapons, take on bounties and discover the dormant evil behind the recent onslaught of bandit attacks.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy different weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to voiced NPC's.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a mini-game and side quest.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat multiple enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and destroy the final boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually saving and loading system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OUT NOW!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro top-down RPG shooter indie game where you play as Mr. Shorty: the heroic ranger in the wild west. Unlock weapons, take on bounties and discover the dormant evil behind the recent onslaught of bandit attacks.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy different weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to voiced NPC's.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a mini-game and side quest.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat multiple enemy types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and destroy the final boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually saving and loading system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OUT NOW!</p></li></ul>",
